{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1824","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. LuoTianyi and the Show"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$n$$$ people taking part in a show about VOCALOID. They will sit in the row of seats, numbered $$$1$$$ to $$$m$$$ from left to right."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$n$$$ people come and sit in order. Each person occupies a seat in one of three ways: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Sit in the seat next to the left of the leftmost person who is already sitting, or if seat $$$1$$$ is taken, then leave the show. If there is no one currently sitting, sit in seat $$$m$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Sit in the seat next to the right of the rightmost person who is already sitting, or if seat $$$m$$$ is taken, then leave the show. If there is no one currently sitting, sit in seat $$$1$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Sit in the seat numbered $$$x_i$$$. If this seat is taken, then leave the show. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Now you want to know what is the maximum number of people that can take a seat, if you can let people into the show in any order?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test consists of multiple test cases. The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases. The description of test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$1 \\le n, m \\le 10^5$$$) — the number of people and the number of seats."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_n$$$ ($$$-2 \\le x_i \\le m$$$, $$$x_i \\ne 0$$$), the $$$i$$$-th of which describes the way in which the $$$i$$$-th person occupies a seat:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If $$$x_i=-1$$$, then $$$i$$$-th person takes the seat in the first way."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If $$$x_i=-2$$$, then $$$i$$$-th person takes the seat in the second way."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If $$$x_i \\gt 0$$$, then the $$$i$$$-th person takes a seat in the third way, i.e. he wants to sit in the seat with the number $$$x_i$$$ or leave the show if it is occupied.. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that sum of $$$n$$$ and the sum of $$$m$$$ over all test cases don't exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case output a single integer — the maximum number of people who can occupy a seat."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_inpu